        "TileImage": "$($repository 1ef4fcd5-a721-4fc0-8fd0-2892c86ea707).Image",
        "Description": "It was while walking through the streets of my town when I realised something. It was not just me; everyone around me was out by themselves. No talking, almost no socialising with those around them. Take away the sounds of cars and the wind and one could hear their blood flowing by their ears. That, and the propane flask explosions.\rRequired Exit: Army Truck",
